  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2230201",
      "subQuestName": "与常九爷对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020101": {
            "id": "223020101",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "这次一定能成功…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020102"
            ]
          },
          "223020102": {
            "id": "223020102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "成功什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020103"
            ]
          },
          "223020103": {
            "id": "223020103",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "你知道稻妻城里，经常会举办一个小说大赛吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020104"
            ]
          },
          "223020104": {
            "id": "223020104",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "好像是叫…「这本小说真厉害！」，还是由稻妻城著名的「八重堂」主办…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020105"
            ]
          },
          "223020105": {
            "id": "223020105",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "为了这个比赛，我已经准备了很久，还看了许多稻妻人喜欢的小说做参考。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020106"
            ]
          },
          "223020106": {
            "id": "223020106",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "再加上我那一屋子通读已久的藏书…把璃月和稻妻的文化融合在一起，我写就的这本小说，一定能拔得头筹！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020107"
            ]
          },
          "223020107": {
            "id": "223020107",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "我已经和飞云商会约好了，他们帮我把我的小说送过去参赛，但是拿书的人一直没来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020108"
            ]
          },
          "223020108": {
            "id": "223020108",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "你有空的话，能帮我把这份手稿送给<color=#00E1FFFF>飞云商会</color>吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020110",
              "223020112"
            ]
          },
          "223020110": {
            "id": "223020110",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "那就拜托你了，这次一定能行…"
          },
          "223020112": {
            "id": "223020112",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "这不能透露，这可是我重要的参赛作品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020113"
            ]
          },
          "223020113": {
            "id": "223020113",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "只要这次能成功，那一切都能好起来…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230202",
      "subQuestName": "将书带去飞云商会",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020201": {
            "id": "223020201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "前面应该就是<color=#00E1FFFF>飞云商会</color>了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020202"
            ]
          },
          "223020202": {
            "id": "223020202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "把书交给<color=#00E1FFFF>门口的那个人</color>，应该就可以了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020203"
            ]
          },
          "223020203": {
            "id": "223020203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过…还是好在意呀，这本小说到底写了什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020204"
            ]
          },
          "223020204": {
            "id": "223020204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样？要悄悄看一下吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230204",
      "subQuestName": "将书带去飞云商会",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020501": {
            "id": "223020501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "就看一眼…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020502"
            ]
          },
          "223020502": {
            "id": "223020502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，嗯！就看一眼！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020503"
            ]
          },
          "223020503": {
            "id": "223020503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "说起来，这个少年…不会就是常九爷自己吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020504"
            ]
          },
          "223020504": {
            "id": "223020504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "他的心态，还挺年轻的呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020505"
            ]
          },
          "223020505": {
            "id": "223020505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔，我们还是快点把这本书送给<color=#00E1FFFF>飞云商会</color>吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230203",
      "subQuestName": "将书交给阿旭",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020301": {
            "id": "223020301",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "少爷到底去哪了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020302"
            ]
          },
          "223020302": {
            "id": "223020302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于常九爷的书…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020303"
            ]
          },
          "223020303": {
            "id": "223020303",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "啊？他…他还在写吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020304"
            ]
          },
          "223020304": {
            "id": "223020304",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "哦对，他上次说，又写了本小说去稻妻城参赛…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020305"
            ]
          },
          "223020305": {
            "id": "223020305",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "这次又是讲什么的？上次他写了本关于七星的书，一个劲要我们帮他出版。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020306"
            ]
          },
          "223020306": {
            "id": "223020306",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "这书没出版，还差点把千岩军给招来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020307"
            ]
          },
          "223020307": {
            "id": "223020307",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "不过，这次既然是去稻妻城参赛，想来也追不到我们头上。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020308"
            ]
          },
          "223020308": {
            "id": "223020308",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "你把书给我吧，我让商会里走船的人顺路带过去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020309"
            ]
          },
          "223020309": {
            "id": "223020309",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "不过，常九爷估计这次也没戏，我听人说，稻妻城那边正流行一本叫《沉秋拾剑录》的书。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020310"
            ]
          },
          "223020310": {
            "id": "223020310",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "也是咱璃月人写的，就是不知道具体是谁…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020311"
            ]
          },
          "223020311": {
            "id": "223020311",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "阿旭",
            "text": "对了，辛苦你把书带过来，本来常九爷是要我们去拿的，还付了钱。既然你把书拿来了，这些就给你吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230204",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020401": {
            "id": "223020401",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "这次，这次一定能成功…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020402"
            ]
          },
          "223020402": {
            "id": "223020402",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "只要成功了，这本书就能卖遍全世界，她也一定能看见这本书…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020403"
            ]
          },
          "223020403": {
            "id": "223020403",
            "speakerId": 1624,
            "speakerName": "常九爷",
            "text": "你，你怎么还在这？快点把书送去<color=#00E1FFFF>飞云商会</color>吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230206",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223020601": {
            "id": "223020601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "还是不看了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223020602"
            ]
          },
          "223020602": {
            "id": "223020602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好吧，毕竟是人家写的书，没得到允许，偷看了确实不太好…"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}